# The dev image's build context (docker/Dockerfile) admits only the files the
# build reads. Everything else stays out, above all Novation's firmware: it
# must never reach a build context, a layer or a registry. scripts/dev mounts
# it read-only at run time instead.
*
!docker/Dockerfile
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!requirements-dev.txt

# Belt and braces: never these, even if a rule above is widened later.
firmware/
work/
**/*.syx
**/*.bin
**/*.elf
**/*.dis
.git/
.venv/
web/node_modules/
